# Contract Deep Agent: Genie + metadata-aware RAG

Answers contract questions by combining the Contract Lifecycle Management Genie space (structured data) with RAG over contract documents, merged by a Deep Agent into one cited answer. Use from another notebook with `%run /AIA_contract_dir/Rohit/deep_agent_v1`.

| Function | Returns |
| --- | --- |
| `ask(query, session_id, show, agent, metadata, enrich)` | Main entry point: dict with `answer`, `sources`, `metadata`, `rag_query`, `glossary_terms` |
| `chat(query, session_id, show)` / `reset_chat(session_id)` | Conversational entry point with follow-up handling |
| `search_genie_and_rag(query, metadata)` | Genie + metadata-aware RAG in parallel, no agent |
| `query_genie(query)` / `query_rag(query, k)` | `(text, sources)` from one source |
| `retrieve(query, k, rerank)` | Reranked hybrid search chunks |
| `extract_query_metadata(query)` / `build_rag_query(query, meta)` | Metadata dict / question + metadata text |
| `enrich_user_query(query)` | `(enriched_query, enrich_question() result)` |
| `build_contract_agent(model, temperature, system_prompt)` | New Deep Agent, pass to `ask(..., agent=...)` |
| `render_citations(answer, sources)` / `show_answer(result)` | Numbered citations / markdown display |
